<p class="eyebrow" data-copy-en="Character guide" data-copy-zh="角色攻略">Character guide</p>
<h1 data-copy-en="Dawn" data-copy-zh="Dawn">Dawn</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Public-pool access, swimming conversations, dates and the evening beach schedule." data-copy-zh="公共泳池入口、游泳谈心、约会与傍晚海滩时间。">Public-pool access, swimming conversations, dates and the evening beach schedule.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find Dawn</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">Missing actions and useful checks</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">出现地点与时间</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">动作缺失时的检查</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="If_Progress_Stalls"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Four_Separate_Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quiet_Water"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="False_Start"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Lane_Rhythm"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="H2H_Best_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Personal_H2Hs"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Unlocking_the_Pool"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Dawn — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/dawn.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Dawn — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/dawn.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Dawn — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Dawn is based at the public pool, with a later beach appearance after the relationship develops. Her three personal heart-to-hearts have a clear order; her dates are separate optional activities.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats_and_Schedule"></span><h2>Where to find Dawn</h2><p>First commission the public pool through Diane at the Town Hall office:$2,000,000 and 180 minutes. This is the university-area public pool, not the brothel pool built by Gastoff. Dawn trains there 09:00–17:00 every day.</p><p>Her beach visit requires Acquaintance(50) and happens only on even-numbered game days,17:00–20:00.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Location</th><th scope="col">Portrait schedule</th><th scope="col">Condition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">University Pool</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Condition"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">City Beach (Uptown)</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">even days, 17:00–20:00</td><td data-label="Condition">Acquaintance (50)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Windows refer to the time you start an action; the ending time is excluded.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Step-by-Step_Personal_Route"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Start Lane Rhythm at Known(25). At Close Friend(200), complete False Start after the first conversation. Quiet Water then needs Crush(400) and a 15:00–17:00 start. The dates below do not substitute for a required conversation.</p><p>The boardwalk date additionally requires Diane’s boardwalk restoration. Because it is offered during Dawn’s beach appearance, it remains an even-day activity.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Result / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Lane Rhythm</th><td data-label="Location / start window">University Pool; 09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">45 min; −10 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">heart-to-heart; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Pool Training Date</th><td data-label="Location / start window">University Pool; 09:00–15:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acquaintance (50)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">90 min; $20; −30 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">False Start</th><td data-label="Location / start window">University Pool; 09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200); after Lane Rhythm</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −15 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">heart-to-heart; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Zoo Date</th><td data-label="Location / start window">University Pool; 09:00–16:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $100; −45 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Win Her a Prize</th><td data-label="Location / start window">University Pool; 12:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); not currently pregnant</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; Voucher ×1</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Quiet Water</th><td data-label="Location / start window">University Pool; 15:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Crush (400); after False Start</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">75 min; −20 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">heart-to-heart; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Boardwalk Sunset Date</th><td data-label="Location / start window">City Beach (Uptown); even days, 17:00–20:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200); after Restoring the Boardwalk</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $80; −35 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Conversation.2C_Gifts_and_Race_Pacing"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Conversation,_Gifts_and_Race_Pacing"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><p>Race Pacing gives Ability+1 once at Known(25) with Communication 35 and 30 minutes. Flowers use an ordinary Flowers item. The Voucher fair date is limited by Dawn’s pool appearance: start before 17:00, even though the action’s wider time range extends later.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Result / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Dawn</th><td data-label="Location / start window">University Pool; 09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">4 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Race Pacing</th><td data-label="Location / start window">University Pool; 09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25); Communication 35</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">30 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">Ability +1; base relationship +10; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Flowers</th><td data-label="Location / start window">University Pool; 09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">10 min; Flowers ×1</td><td data-label="Result / limit">2 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Dawn</th><td data-label="Location / start window">City Beach (Uptown); even days, 17:00–20:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acquaintance (50)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">3 safe uses/day</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><h2>Missing actions and useful checks</h2><p>No pool portrait usually means the public pool is not built or you are outside 09:00–17:00. A missing beach portrait can instead mean the day is odd or the relationship is below Acquaintance.</p><p>For Quiet Water, check the second completed heart-to-heart and the afternoon start window. Arriving after 17:00 to look for that pool conversation will not work.</p></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><p><a href="character-diane.html">Diane’s public projects</a> · <a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships</a> · <a href="skills.html">Skills</a></p></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-If_Progress_Stalls"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Four_Separate_Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quiet_Water"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-False_Start"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Lane_Rhythm"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-H2H_Best_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Personal_H2Hs"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Unlocking_the_Pool"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Dawn 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/dawn.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Dawn 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/dawn.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Dawn 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Dawn主要在公共泳池活动，关系推进后才会在傍晚去海滩。她的三次个人谈心有明确顺序，约会则是另外的可选活动。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats_and_Schedule"></span><h2>出现地点与时间</h2><p>先到市政厅办公室向Diane委托建设公共泳池，消耗财富2,000,000与180分钟。这是大学区域的公共泳池，与Gastoff建设的青楼泳池不同。Dawn每天09:00—17:00在此训练。</p><p>海滩行程另要求相识（50），并且只在游戏日期为双数时于17:00—20:00出现。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">头像出现时间</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">大学游泳池</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">城市海滩（上城区）</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">双数日，17:00–20:00</td><td data-label="条件">相识（50）</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>时段按开始动作时判定，结束时间不包含在内。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Step-by-Step_Personal_Route"></span><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>已知（25）时先完成「泳道节奏」；达到亲密朋友（200）后，再完成「抢跳」。之后的「静水」要求迷恋（400），并须在15:00—17:00开始。下方约会不能代替前置谈心。</p><p>木板路约会还要求Diane完成木板路修复。该动作在Dawn的海滩行程中提供，因此仍只在双数日可用。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">动作</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">结果／限制</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">泳道节奏</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">大学游泳池; 09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">45分钟；−10 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">谈心，一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">泳池训练约会</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">大学游泳池; 09:00–15:00</td><td data-label="条件">相识（50）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">90分钟；财富20；−30 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">抢跳</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">大学游泳池; 09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）；完成：泳道节奏</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60分钟；−15 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">谈心，一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">动物园约会</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">大学游泳池; 09:00–16:00</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120分钟；财富100；−45 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">替她赢个奖品</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">大学游泳池; 12:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）；当前未怀孕</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120分钟；兑换券 ×1</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">静水</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">大学游泳池; 15:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">迷恋（400）；完成：抢跳</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">75分钟；−20 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">谈心，一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">海滨栈道日落约会</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">城市海滩（上城区）; 双数日，17:00–20:00</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）；完成：重修海滨木栈道</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120分钟；财富80；−35 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Conversation.2C_Gifts_and_Race_Pacing"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Conversation,_Gifts_and_Race_Pacing"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><p>已知（25）且沟通35时，可花30分钟进行一次「比赛配速」，永久增加能力1。送花会消耗普通鲜花。凭兑换券的游乐场活动仍受泳池出勤时间限制，须在17:00前开始，不能仅按动作较宽的时间范围等到更晚。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">动作</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">结果／限制</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">和 Dawn 交谈</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">大学游泳池; 09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">15分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">4次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">比赛配速</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">大学游泳池; 09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25）；沟通35</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">30分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">能力 +1；基础关系+10；一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送花</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">大学游泳池; 09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">10分钟；鲜花 ×1</td><td data-label="结果／限制">2次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">和 Dawn 交谈</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">城市海滩（上城区）; 双数日，17:00–20:00</td><td data-label="条件">相识（50）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">15分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">3次／日安全额度</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><h2>动作缺失时的检查</h2><p>泳池没有头像时，先检查公共泳池是否建成，以及当前是否在09:00—17:00。海滩没有头像，则还可能是单数日，或尚未达到相识。</p><p>最后一次泳池谈心要检查第二次谈心是否完成，以及下午的开始时段；17:00后再去泳池找这项谈心已经太晚。</p></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>相关指南</h2><p><a href="character-diane.html">Diane的公共建设</a> · <a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">关系、约会与亲密</a> · <a href="skills.html">技能</a></p></section>
